sequenceDiagram
    participant BE as Backend
    participant CP as CreateCheckPoint
    participant WAL as WAL System
    participant BM as Buffer Manager
    participant CF as Control File
    participant FS as File System

    Note over CP: Checkpoint begins - critical section
    CP->>CP: START_CRIT_SECTION()

    alt Online Checkpoint
        Note over CP: Insert REDO record to establish recovery point
        CP->>WAL: XLogBeginInsert()
        CP->>WAL: XLogRegisterData(wal_level)
        CP->>WAL: XLogInsert(XLOG_CHECKPOINT_REDO)
        Note over WAL: REDO record LSN becomes new RedoRecPtr
        WAL->>CP: Return LSN (new redo point)
        CP->>CP: checkpoint.redo = RedoRecPtr
    else Shutdown Checkpoint
        Note over CP: Compute REDO point directly
        CP->>CP: checkpoint.redo = curInsert
        CP->>WAL: Update RedoRecPtr = checkpoint.redo
    end

    Note over CP: Collect transaction state for checkpoint record
    CP->>CP: Get nextXid, oldestXid, etc.

    Note over CP: Wait for commit critical sections
    CP->>CP: GetVirtualXIDsDelayingChkpt(DELAY_CHKPT_START)

    loop While transactions in commit critical section
        CP->>CP: AbsorbSyncRequests()
        CP->>CP: pg_usleep(10ms)
    end

    Note over CP: Begin core checkpoint work
    CP->>CP: CheckPointGuts(checkpoint.redo, flags)

    Note over CP: WAL-before-data rule enforcement
    loop For each dirty buffer
        BM->>BM: Check BufferGetLSN(bufHdr)
        alt Buffer LSN > RedoRecPtr
            BM->>WAL: XLogFlush(BufferGetLSN(bufHdr))
            WAL->>FS: Write & fsync WAL to disk
            FS-->>WAL: Confirm WAL flushed
            WAL-->>BM: LSN flushed confirmation
        end
        BM->>FS: Write buffer to data file
    end

    Note over CP: Process fsync requests
    CP->>FS: ProcessSyncRequests() - fsync all data files

    Note over CP: Wait for remaining commit critical sections
    CP->>CP: GetVirtualXIDsDelayingChkpt(DELAY_CHKPT_COMPLETE)

    loop While transactions still in critical section
        CP->>CP: AbsorbSyncRequests()
        CP->>CP: pg_usleep(10ms)
    end

    Note over CP: Insert final checkpoint record
    CP->>WAL: XLogBeginInsert()
    CP->>WAL: XLogRegisterData(checkPoint)

    alt Shutdown Checkpoint
        CP->>WAL: XLogInsert(XLOG_CHECKPOINT_SHUTDOWN)
    else Online Checkpoint
        CP->>WAL: XLogInsert(XLOG_CHECKPOINT_ONLINE)
    end

    WAL->>CP: Return checkpoint record LSN

    Note over CP: Ensure checkpoint record is durable
    CP->>WAL: XLogFlush(checkpoint_record_LSN)
    WAL->>FS: Write & fsync checkpoint record
    FS-->>WAL: Confirm checkpoint record on disk

    Note over CP: Update control file with new checkpoint info
    CP->>CF: LWLockAcquire(ControlFileLock, LW_EXCLUSIVE)
    CP->>CF: ControlFile->checkPoint = checkpoint_record_LSN
    CP->>CF: ControlFile->checkPointCopy = checkPoint
    CP->>CF: UpdateControlFile()
    CF->>FS: Write & fsync control file
    FS-->>CF: Confirm control file updated
    CP->>CF: LWLockRelease(ControlFileLock)

    Note over CP: Checkpoint complete - end critical section
    CP->>CP: END_CRIT_SECTION()

    Note over CP: Post-checkpoint cleanup
    CP->>CP: RemoveOldXlogFiles() - WAL segment cleanup
    CP->>CP: PreallocXlogFiles() - WAL preallocation

    Note over BE,FS: Timeline showing durability guarantees

    Note right of WAL: WAL records always<br/>flushed before data
    Note right of CF: Control file update<br/>makes checkpoint<br/>discoverable on restart
    Note right of FS: All data durable<br/>at checkpoint completion